{"text": "When the bell struck one, the first spirit appeared beside Scrooges bed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was a strange figure, like a child and an old man at the same time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A bright, clear light shone from the top of its head. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I am the Ghost of Christmas Past, it said, Your past. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The spirit took him back to the school where he had spent lonely Christmases as a boy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Scrooge saw his younger self reading alone, and he began to cry. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Next, they visited old Mister Fezziwig, who had been Scrooges kind master. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Fezziwig gave a happy Christmas party, and everyone danced until eleven oclock. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The happiness he gives is as great as if it cost a fortune, said Scrooge. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then Scrooge saw a young woman named Belle, who had once loved him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She said that a golden idol, money, had taken her place in his heart. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Show me no more, cried Scrooge, for he could not bear to watch.", "alignment": {"characters": ["W", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "e", "l", "l", " ", "s", "t", "r", "u", "c", "k", " ", "o", "n", "e", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "i", "r", "s", "t", " ", "s", "p", "i", "r", "i", "t", " ", "a", "p", "p", "e", "a", "r", "e", "d", " ", "b", "e", "s", "i", "d", "e", " ", "S", "c", "r", "o", "o", "g", "e", "s", " ", "b", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "s", "t", "r", "a", "n", "g", "e", " ", "f", "i", "g", "u", "r", "e", ",", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", " ", "c", "h", "i", "l", "d", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", "n", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "m", "e", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k"